    {
      "id": "rung_main_a292319a-efd0-403d-a1f9-c0f452f7e511",
      "comment": "Film length: Film_Len_Used = LIMIT(FilmMin, FilmLength, FilmMax), FeedPulses = Film_Len_Used / FilmPulseMM. LIMIT keeps a wrong HMI entry (0, negative, 5000) inside 600-1200 mm, so FeedPulses is always 12-24 (INT division truncates: 850 / 50 = 17). Same idea as the syrup room's guard against division by zero, with one block",
      "defaultBounds": [
        300,
        100
      ],
      "reactFlowViewport": [
        826,
        214
      ],
